Package: disunified
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: TechBlueprints <https://github.com/TechBlueprints/disunified>
Section: net
Priority: optional
Depends: systemd
Description: presents a non-UniFi device to a UniFi Network controller as an adopted UniFi switch
 Independent project, not affiliated with or endorsed by Ubiquiti Inc.
 It runs on the device it presents: on a SONiC switch (as the admin user,
 its config and state in /host/disunified) or on a Proxmox VE node (as
 root, config in /etc/disunified, state in /var/lib/disunified). See
 docs/install.md.
